    <string name="cmd_help_general">Chain commands with ; · schedule with in 30m: or when charging: · {clip} {sel} {date} {time} {location} {maps} are filled in · name? shows a contact · an address (site.com) opens the site · !! repeats the last one\n› theme dark; dnd on\n› in 30m: torch off\n› note {clip}</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_repeat">Runs the last command again.\n› !!</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_schedule">Runs a command later, or every time something happens. Write when, a colon and the command. scheduled lists them.\nEvents: %1$s\n› in 30m: theme dark\n› at 22h: dnd on\n› tomorrow 7h: wifi\n› when charging: rotation off</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_alias">Alias of: %1$s</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_custom">A command of your own, set up in the command bar settings.</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_task">Adds a task to the tasks app.\n› t buy bread</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_open">Opens an app by its name. A word that is not a command opens the app too.\n› open chrome\n› chrome</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_alarm">Sets an alarm in the clock app. Days after the time make it repeat.\n› alarm 6:30\n› alarm 7h mon-fri\n› alarm 0830 weekend</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_calc" formatted="false">Math, units, currencies and percentages. Enter copies the result; c is the short form.\n› calc 2*(3+4)\n› calc 5 km in mi\n› calc 100 usd in brl\n› c 15% of 230</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_call">Calls a contact found by the start of any of their names. name? shows the number and the e-mail.\n› call ana\n› ana?</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_route">Opens directions to a place in the maps app.\n› route airport\n› route 5th avenue 100</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_split">Opens two apps side by side in split screen. Separate them with /.\n› split chrome / notes</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_theme">invert swaps the accent and the background, light and dark set the mode, system follows the system mode and default puts everything back. Each element changes on its own: accent, background, secondary, outline, dock and folder take a color (#rrggbb or default); font takes a Google Fonts or system font; clock, icons, wallpaper and paint take on or off; widgets and crt take on, off or an intensity; dim takes a percentage. A theme name applies a saved or ready-made theme; save keeps the one on screen, share sends it as a .tthm file and delete removes a saved one. ai theme designs a new one.\n› theme dark\n› theme accent #ffb000\n› theme font Space Mono\n› theme crt 40%\n› theme save night\n› theme share night</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_timer">Starts a timer in the clock app, up to 7 days.\n› timer 10m\n› timer 1h30\n› timer 90s</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_remind">Notifies you at a time. A bare time is the next time the clock shows it; in counts from now.\n› remind in 30m take out the trash\n› remind 18h call mom\n› remind tomorrow 9h meeting</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_wifi">Opens the Wi-Fi panel of the system: Android does not let apps switch it directly.\n› wifi</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_bluetooth">Opens the Bluetooth panel of the system: Android does not let apps switch it directly. bt is the short form.\n› bluetooth\n› bt</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_torch">Turns the flashlight on or off. Alone, it flips.\n› flashlight\n› flashlight on\n› flashlight off</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_dnd">Turns do not disturb on or off. Alone, it flips. The first time asks for access to it.\n› dnd\n› dnd on</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_rotation">Turns auto-rotate on or off. Alone, it flips. The first time asks to change system settings.\n› rotation\n› rotation off</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_brightness">Sets the screen brightness in percent, or automatic. The first time asks to change system settings.\n› brightness 40\n› brightness auto</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_volume">Sets the media volume in percent; mute is 0. vol is the short form.\n› volume 30\n› vol mute</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_media">Media keys for the app that is playing.\n› play\n› pause\n› next\n› previous</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_copy">Copies text to the clipboard. Variables like {time} are filled in.\n› copy see you at {time}</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_paste">Puts what was copied on the command line, to edit or run it.\n› paste</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_settings">Opens a screen of the system settings. Alone, lists them; launcher opens the settings of this launcher.\n› settings battery\n› settings wifi\n› settings launcher</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_agenda">Shows the events of today and tomorrow. Enter opens the calendar.\n› agenda</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_note">Saves a quick note. Alone, lists the notes and Enter shares them all.\n› note buy coffee\n› note</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_scheduled">Lists the reminders, scheduled commands and rules, numbered. Tap one to cancel it.\n› scheduled</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_cancel">Cancels a reminder, scheduled command or rule by its number in scheduled.\n› cancel 2</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_battery">Battery level, charging and temperature. Enter copies it.\n› battery</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_storage">Free and total storage. Enter copies it.\n› storage</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_ip">The IP addresses of the device. Enter copies them.\n› ip</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_uptime">Time since the device was turned on. Enter copies it.\n› uptime</string>
    <string name="cmd_help_ping">Checks if a host answers and shows the times in the bar.\n› ping google.com\n› ping 1.1.1.1</string>
