    <string name="cmd_help_ai">Talks to the AI set up in settings and shows the answer here; keep asking to go on with the conversation. do turns a request into a command of the bar, which waits on the line for Enter. create writes a new command and opens the import screen. Only the request, the commands and the app names are sent. folders sorts the apps into app drawer folders and shows the plan before anything changes. theme designs a theme and shows it before applying.\n› ai how many cups in a liter\n› ai do dnd on; in 1h: dnd off\n› ai create search on imdb\n› ai summarize {clip}\n› ai folders\n› ai folders --force\n› ai theme 80s neon with a typewriter font</string>
